<view class="product-page"><view wx:if="{{item}}"><view class="detail-intro"><text class="detail-badge">{{item.badge}}</text><view class="detail-title">{{item.name}}</view><view class="detail-subtitle">{{item.subtitle}}</view></view><view class="detail-hero"><image src="{{item.image}}" mode="aspectFit" /></view><view class="detail-content"><view class="price-label">演示价格</view><view class="detail-price">¥{{amount}}</view><view class="detail-description">{{item.description}}</view><view class="highlights"><view wx:for="{{item.highlights}}" wx:key="*this"><text>＋</text>{{item}}</view></view><view class="quantity-row"><text>数量</text><view class="quantity-picker"><button data-delta="-1" bindtap="quantity" aria-label="减少商品数量">−</button><text>{{quantity}}</text><button data-delta="1" bindtap="quantity" aria-label="增加商品数量">＋</button></view></view><view class="detail-note">{{item.note}}。后续款与生活好物为设计概念，实物上市信息待确认。</view></view><view class="detail-bottom"><button class="view-bag" bindtap="bag">查看购物袋</button><button class="add-to-bag" bindtap="add">{{added ? '已加入 · 再加一件' : '加入购物袋'}}</button></view></view><view wx:else class="empty">这件好物暂时找不到了。</view></view>
